ness_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"kBgiy6ulQRiATWFPZjTPKA","review_id":"1ult_BuewdV4E6LJ6muoVQ","date":"2019-08-23T22:31:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9628921151161194,"text_excerpt":"The beignet's here are way better than Cafe Du Monde. They're crispy, not too oily, and light (not doughy). Overall awesome experience at this place"},{"business_id":"kBgiy6ulQRiATWFPZjTPKA","review_id":"8yVysBpPlW4lIz-bjOQpPA","date":"2018-01-27T01:21:08","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9519816040992737,"text_excerpt":"Had the beignets here and they were fairly good and just as good as Cafe Du Monde. My daughter did mention that these beignets are fluffier than Cafe Du Monde.... she's a donut eating person, I'm not. I did like the establishment here because of the live jazz music, that was a nice touch for me. The beignet's here are a dollar more, than Cafe Du Monde. Overall I suggest give both establishments a try and judge for yourself."},{"business_id":"kBgiy6ulQRiATWFPZjTPKA","review_id":"chYkK3n8lXlVVk9jad_HcA","date":"2019-02-12T18:44:17","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9499645829200745,"text_excerpt":"I will preface this review by saying, I only had coffee(s) and beignets at Cafe Beignet. We never wanted to try other food there, because we figured the restaurants in the area would do a better job at serving up \"authentic\"/flavorful Cajun food. That being said... in the \"battle\" of Cafe Beignet's beignets vs Cafe Du Monde, it wasn't even close which beignets we preferred. Cafe Beignet was hands down our favorite. The beignets at Cafe Beignet we're pretty much the same size as Cafe Du Monde, but what we really liked about Cafe Beignet's beignets were that they were always hot, crispy, and airy. They were very light; whereas, we found Cafe Du Monde's to be a little more dense and chewy - ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"kBgiy6ulQRiATWFPZjTPKA","photo_id":"KtZ9B9nc4sRPi8LZdJYGOQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/KtZ9B9nc4sRPi8LZdJYGOQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8987942934036255},{"business_id":"kBgiy6ulQRiATWFPZjTPKA","photo_id":"14pQHBQEsFuPoOpiXf1ocA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/14pQHBQEsFuPoOpiXf1ocA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8800444602966309},{"business_id":"kBgiy6ulQRiATWFPZjTPKA","photo_id":"LAfmDnUB5hJfQ6qhCFmDSw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/LAfmDnUB5hJfQ6qhCFmDSw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8709678053855896},{"business_id":"kBgiy6ulQRiATWFPZjTPKA","photo_id":"UV2qyN4AJpT4QuPnTfcjZQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/UV2qyN4AJpT4QuPnTfcjZQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8541768789291382},{"business_id":"kBgiy6ulQRiATWFPZjTPKA","photo_id":"ZQ-VekxzvWkmxeXBusmUwg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ZQ-VekxzvWkmxeXBusmUwg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.792813777923584}]},"notebook_case":null}
